ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040245557139_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040245557139_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/match1942411date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">遭绝杀！友谊赛荷兰0-1阿尔及利亚 赖因德斯进球无效 穆萨建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260604/zhanbao_image_1942411_1780519015_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260604/zhanbao_image_1942411_1780519015_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260604/zhanbao_image_1942411_1780519015_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>哈迪·穆萨绝杀，荷兰0-1阿尔及利亚。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/match1982273date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">友谊赛-意大利1-0卢森堡 埃斯波西托制胜球皮西利助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260604/zhanbao_image_1982273_1780518600_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260604/zhanbao_image_1982273_1780518600_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260604/zhanbao_image_1982273_1780518600_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>埃斯波西托破门打进全场唯一进球，意大利1-0击败卢森堡。</p><p><strong>【老佛爷PK里克尔梅】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a208949a564dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">弗洛伦蒂诺宣布：若赢得皇马主席选举，穆里尼奥将执教皇马</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.21" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040414031172.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.21" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.21" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040414031172.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040414031172.jpg"> </div><p>弗洛伦蒂诺在参选皇马主席的账号发布视频，晒出穆里尼奥身穿皇马球衣视频，表示若自己成功赢得选举，穆帅将成为皇马新帅。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a209e3e2bc61native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">老佛爷：穆帅和科纳特是我的首批“引援” 姆巴佩维尼修斯会留下</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2.04" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040536461236.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2.04" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2.04" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040536461236_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040536461236_720.jpg"> </div><p>弗洛伦蒂诺接受《阿斯报》采访，确认穆里尼奥和科纳特将是他今夏为皇马带来的第一批引援。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a20976c38258native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">回应老佛爷！里克尔梅：若当选皇马主席将签下哈兰德和罗德里</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.18" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040509328453_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.18" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.18" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040509328453_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040509328453_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马主席竞选者里克尔梅宣布，他若当选皇马主席将签下哈兰德与罗德里。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a2090e26c1e1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">里克尔梅回应老佛爷签下穆帅：我另有主帅人选，他是耀眼明星</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040440055413.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040440055413.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040440055413.jpg"> </div><p>弗洛伦蒂诺宣布已签下穆里尼奥，他的竞选对手里克尔梅进行了回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a20a6dda788enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：里克尔梅团队已至少2次与克洛普会谈，希望他执教皇马</a></p><p><strong>【转会新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a20a2b73d6d0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：科纳特将加盟皇马，双方签约四年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040555173116_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040555173116_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040555173116_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以here we go确认，科纳特将加盟皇马，他与皇马签下四年合约。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a2080280c0bdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：皇马正式告知国米将支付邓弗里斯解约金，球员已完成体检</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040327518191_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040327518191_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260604/202606040327518191_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺更新邓弗里斯转会最新消息，皇马已正式告知国米将支付解约金。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-04/6a20771b7fc01native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">基耶利尼确认弗拉霍维奇将离队：他想要更高薪水 目前看不会留下</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250826/68ad9d5c72ee3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250826/68ad9d5c72ee3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250826/68ad9d5c72ee3.jpg"> </div><p>直播吧06月04日讯 尤文总监基耶利尼确认，弗拉霍维奇将自由身离队。